PARSFILE
#FullDataName Animator: HUD`ACC Icon for Medium Lead`ACC - Adaptive Cruise Control
#CheckBox1 1    
#CheckBox3 0    

#RingCtrl0 1
#RingCtrl1 2
#RingCtrl2 1
#RingCtrl3 2
#RingCtrl4 1
*VAR_NAME_1 MagS1_1


#Selection 2 for Icon 0
#Selection_1 2 for Icon
